omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YRVHgNITAk0Q7kNvwFO_58e&_nc_oc=Adqh8_rsYoJZ6t-5NLJMN0p5NOIx0dRlfiFRIxEb9yAxrikjIXtww3tsJB8_vzYD8gs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNCk7OiwCK8KD5AwjzU6gUv2ebtyDFZPBzigwTJBwOX5Q&oe=6AC26F34"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mD-yRbNwe_4Q7kNvwHF4jh8&_nc_oc=AdpyLfTIuEBLa5hWwtIGvfKRg44l0hzAStYuVJLEA1Bhh0sPgrhCZqxdNFpovb8B_ag&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMRL2zy51cABo_2eHUAQeLGEbUKWbNqT35yRNIT4buIzQ&oe=6AC27096"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fNO-moWklHYQ7kNvwHqtT7a&_nc_oc=Adrv7f2HRhPnVX7V4iKG6xAvQOMvqpUcQZi4i1ABBdA6YaTLEkoTPEveDB9mCuQ01oU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMgAF718sS91GLyv2LzsuP9d68rDPJdrrOx4oXvo7BE-Q&oe=6AC24D77"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://